IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `coa-core`
IMPORT `coa8-part15-group`

-- Tests of ss 399 to 408 (group accounts). Every expected value was written from the text before the run.

-- s 399(2B): (a) UK-established, (b) must prepare accounts under this Part, (c) transferable securities admitted to trading / CRR credit institution / would-be insurer
