#ASSERT `s 399(2B) the undertaking falls within this subsection` TRUE TRUE FALSE NOTHING (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 399(2B) the undertaking falls within this subsection` FALSE TRUE FALSE NOTHING (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
