-- group accounts prepared: parent and subsidiary undertakings all on the Companies Act framework
#ASSERT `s 407(1) the directors have secured that the individual accounts are prepared using the same financial reporting framework` TRUE FALSE (`s 407 individual accounts of an undertaking` OF `s 395(1)(a) Companies Act individual accounts`, TRUE, FALSE) (LIST (`s 407 individual accounts of an undertaking` OF `s 395(1)(a) Companies Act individual accounts`, TRUE, FALSE), (`s 407 individual accounts of an undertaking` OF `s 395(1)(a) Companies Act individual accounts`, TRUE, FALSE)) FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- one subsidiary undertaking on IAS: not the same framework, unless the directors have good reasons
#ASSERT `s 407(1) the directors have secured that the individual accounts are prepared using the same financial reporting framework` TRUE FALSE (`s 407 individual accounts of an undertaking` OF `s 395(1)(a) Companies Act individual accounts`, TRUE, FALSE) (LIST (`s 407 individual accounts of an undertaking` OF `s 395(1)(a) Companies Act individual accounts`, TRUE, FALSE), (`s 407 individual accounts of an undertaking` OF `s 395(1)(b) IAS individual accounts`, TRUE, FALSE)) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 407(1) the directors have secured that the individual accounts are prepared using the same financial reporting framework` TRUE FALSE (`s 407 individual accounts of an undertaking` OF `s 395(1)(a) Companies Act individual accounts`, TRUE, FALSE) (LIST (`s 407 individual accounts of an undertaking` OF `s 395(1)(b) IAS individual accounts`, TRUE, FALSE)) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- subsection (3): a subsidiary undertaking whose accounts are not required under this Part is left out
