-- subsection (4): a charity is compared only with other charities
#ASSERT `s 407(1) the directors have secured that the individual accounts are prepared using the same financial reporting framework` TRUE FALSE (`s 407 individual accounts of an undertaking` OF `s 395(1)(a) Companies Act individual accounts`, TRUE, FALSE) (LIST (`s 407 individual accounts of an undertaking` OF `s 395(1)(b) IAS individual accounts`, TRUE, TRUE)) FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 407(1) the directors have secured that the individual accounts are prepared using the same financial reporting framework` TRUE FALSE (`s 407 individual accounts of an undertaking` OF `s 395(1)(a) Companies Act individual accounts`, TRUE, FALSE) (LIST (`s 407 individual accounts of an undertaking` OF `s 395(1)(a) Companies Act individual accounts`, TRUE, TRUE), (`s 407 individual accounts of an undertaking` OF `s 395(1)(b) IAS individual accounts`, TRUE, TRUE)) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- subsection (5): IAS group accounts and IAS individual accounts: the parent's own accounts are left out of the comparison
#ASSERT `s 407(1) the directors have secured that the individual accounts are prepared using the same financial reporting framework` TRUE TRUE (`s 407 individual accounts of an undertaking` OF `s 395(1)(a) Companies Act individual accounts`, TRUE, FALSE) (LIST (`s 407 individual accounts of an undertaking` OF `s 395(1)(b) IAS individual accounts`, TRUE, FALSE), (`s 407 individual accounts of an undertaking` OF `s 395(1)(b) IAS individual accounts`, TRUE, FALSE)) FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
